# Candidate trajectories are ~4.6 MB each and fully regenerable: the tuple in
# candidates/<id>.json plus 101_export_pool_shot.py --shot reproduces them
# byte-for-byte. The tuples, the sweep report and the WINNER (promoted to
# assets/data/shots/break_film.json) are all committed; the raw intermediates
# are not.
assets/data/shots/candidates/out/

# Silent master + film intermediates: the shipped file is site/break-film.mp4
renders/film_out/

# Python bytecode from the Blender/venv script runs
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# macOS duplicate-file artifacts (" 2" copies of tracked textures)
* 2.png
* 2.webp
